From 6ecd06383be06c3970f163414c0c1185e4251476 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Pascal <admin@serveurperso.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 11:48:56 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] model: add Muse Spark Open (text, vision and audio)

Port ba3c05f71 onto the mesh-llm llama.cpp pin. GGUF-conversion python is omitted; the pinned tree needs load, chat-template and staged-graph support. Resolutions keep both the Inkling dMel audio preprocessor and the Muse Spark audio preprocessor, and keep both projector types out of the standard-layer load path.
